{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_01",
      "hash": "6aead4e0ca20f79e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～你能拿你的小拉达\\n和我的小拉达交换吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_02",
      "hash": "6aead3e0ca20f5eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～真是遗憾！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_03",
      "hash": "6aead2e0ca20f438",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_04",
      "hash": "6aead9e0ca21001d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～好开心！\\n那我们开始交换吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_05",
      "hash": "6aead8e0ca20fe6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "很吃惊吧？\\n我的小拉达来自阿罗拉地区哦！\\c\\n有些宝可梦虽然种类相同，\\n但因出生地不一样，\\c\\n会拥有不同的样子或属性哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_06",
      "hash": "6aead7e0ca20fcb7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～还想用关都的小拉达\\n来交换阿罗拉的小拉达吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_07",
      "hash": "6aead6e0ca20fb04",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谢谢你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_01",
      "hash": "e79f3df307b71a1f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我从阿罗拉专程来到这里，就是为了\\n多多收集关都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]。\\c\\n如果你有[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的话，\\n就来和我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]交换吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_02",
      "hash": "e79f3ef307b71bd2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是吗……\\n改变主意的话记得来找我啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_03",
      "hash": "e79f3ff307b71d85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_04",
      "hash": "e79f38f307b711a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你愿意把它换给我吗？\\n好嘞！交换成立！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_05",
      "hash": "e79f39f307b71353",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "感谢你这绝美的交换！\\n阿罗拉的样子的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\c\\n和关都的不同，\\n还拥有冰属性哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_06",
      "hash": "e79f3af307b71506",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你还愿意拿关都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n和我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]交换吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_07",
      "hash": "e79f3bf307b716b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谢了！哎呀～关都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n真是让人欲罢不能～！\\c\\n当然阿罗拉地区的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n也可爱十足呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_01",
      "hash": "6dda7e9a6151ef78",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "关都的地鼠\\n都是这么滑滑的吗？\\c\\n想不想用它换我那摸起来\\n有刺刺感觉的地鼠呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_02",
      "hash": "6dda819a6151f491",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀……真是让人着急……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_03",
      "hash": "6dda809a6151f2de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 16]"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_04",
      "hash": "6dda839a6151f7f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘻嘻！我现在兴奋得心扑通扑通跳呢。\\n那么，要交换了哦……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_05",
      "hash": "6dda829a6151f644",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇啊啊！真的呢～！\\n好滑滑的感觉～！\\c\\n能遇到你真是太好了！\\n以后再来跟我交换哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_06",
      "hash": "6dda859a6151fb5d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "又想用你那滑滑的地鼠\\n换我这刺刺的地鼠了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_07",
      "hash": "6dda849a6151f9aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "滑滑的地鼠真的是\\n怎么看都不嫌多，可爱的很呢！\\r\\n以后还要来跟我交换哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_01",
      "hash": "0edd0ba62ac6c684",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……对恶属性感兴趣吗？\\n要是你有[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的话，\\c\\n我也是可以用恶属性的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n和你交换的……"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_02",
      "hash": "0edd0ea62ac6cb9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵，那就算了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_03",
      "hash": "0edd0da62ac6c9ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 23]"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_04",
      "hash": "0edd08a62ac6c16b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵，想好了吗？\\n那么，开始交换吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_05",
      "hash": "0edd07a62ac6bfb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "怎么样？恶属性的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n也是极其小巧可爱吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_06",
      "hash": "0edd0aa62ac6c4d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "又想要恶属性的宝可梦了吗？\\n要是你有关都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的话，\\c\\n我也是可以用我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n和你交换的……"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_07",
      "hash": "0edd09a62ac6c31e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……你还真是喜欢恶属性呢。\\n要是想再沾染一点恶气的话，\\r\\n再来找我好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_01",
      "hash": "169a75a819e149d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是来自阿罗拉的雷丘爱好者！\\c\\n你愿意拿关都的雷丘\\n和我的雷丘交换吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_02",
      "hash": "169a72a819e144c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真的很可爱呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_03",
      "hash": "169a73a819e14673",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 30]"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_04",
      "hash": "169a78a819e14ef2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "决定好换哪一只了吗？\\n那么，我们来交换吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_05",
      "hash": "169a79a819e150a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿罗拉的雷丘拥有\\n电和超能力这两种属性。\\c\\n它可是通过招式学习器学会了\\n“精神强念”的超棒宝可梦呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_06",
      "hash": "169a76a819e14b8c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是来自阿罗拉的雷丘爱好者！\\c\\n你愿意拿关都的雷丘和\\n我的阿罗拉的雷丘交换吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_07",
      "hash": "169a77a819e14d3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你要让更多人知道\\n阿罗拉的雷丘的可爱之处哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_01",
      "hash": "7877d33166b0ec78",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "说你呢！不知道你有没有\\n地面属性的嘎啦嘎啦？\\c\\n如果可以的话，\\n我想用我的嘎啦嘎啦跟你交换……"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_02",
      "hash": "7877d63166b0f191",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是不会强迫你的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub064_gentle_03",
      "hash": "a5de094ea254826f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 37]"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_04",
      "hash": "7877d83166b0f4f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "做好心理准备了？\\n那么……"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_05",
      "hash": "7877d73166b0f344",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "吼～！\\n我最喜欢地面属性的嘎啦嘎啦了！\\c\\n要是将来有机会，\\n我还想再和你换！"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_06",
      "hash": "7877da3166b0f85d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我希望能拿我的阿罗拉的嘎啦嘎啦\\n和你的地面属性的嘎啦嘎啦交换，\\c\\n你觉得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_07",
      "hash": "7877d93166b0f6aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然关都的嘎啦嘎啦\\n就得是地面属性啊……！\\c\\n如果将来还有机会，\\n我还会拜托你的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_01",
      "hash": "8e4f1b712d924db0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你……如果有椰蛋树的话，\\n我可以把我引以为傲的椰蛋树交换给你，\\r\\n你觉得怎么样啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_02",
      "hash": "8e4f1e712d9252c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那可是我引以为傲的椰蛋树……"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_03",
      "hash": "8e4f1d712d925116",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 44]"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_04",
      "hash": "8e4f20712d92562f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "请收下我\\n引以为傲的椰蛋树……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_05",
      "hash": "8e4f1f712d92547c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这只椰蛋树很炫酷吧～！\\n在遥远的阿罗拉地区，\\c\\n椰蛋树们茁壮地成长，\\n所以才长得这么长！"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_06",
      "hash": "8e4f22712d925995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "又想来交换\\n我引以为傲的椰蛋树了吗？\\c\\n你如果有短脖子的椰蛋树，\\n我也是可以和你交换的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_07",
      "hash": "8e4f21712d9257e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只是因为生长的环境不同，\\c\\n就能产生如此大的变化，\\n生命，真是妙不可言啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_01",
      "hash": "608d3c6d3ab94808",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要用你的小拳石\\n来换我的小拳石吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_02",
      "hash": "608d3f6d3ab94d21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎……真可惜！"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_04",
      "hash": "608d416d3ab95087",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嚯嚯！太好了！\\n那么，让我们来交换吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_05",
      "hash": "608d406d3ab94ed4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇哈哈！吓了一跳吧！？\\n我的小拳石可是\\r\\n阿罗拉的样子！\\c\\n如果你有关都的小拳石\\n再来和我交换吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_06",
      "hash": "608d436d3ab953ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "噢，你又想来和我\\n交换小拳石吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_07",
      "hash": "608d426d3ab9523a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我们通过交换小拳石\\n培养起来的友谊……\\c\\n真是太完美了！\\n哇哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_01",
      "hash": "4f8eb624ac6a712d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小幂妮"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_02",
      "hash": "4f8eb324ac6a6c14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "露冰冰"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_03",
      "hash": "4f8eb424ac6a6dc7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "蒂淑"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_04",
      "hash": "4f8eb124ac6a68ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "达怀丹"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_05",
      "hash": "4f8eb224ac6a6a61",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "晶莹丘"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_06",
      "hash": "4f8eaf24ac6a6548",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "申史加拉"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_07",
      "hash": "4f8eb024ac6a66fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "艾浩舒"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_08",
      "hash": "4f8ead24ac6a61e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "科布"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
